and you get teleported (i'd like it if that overrode teleport control
and maybe even teleport blocking); alas, this effect can be blocked by
magic cancellation, which means you usually won't see it in a normal
game. Imagine a quantum mechanic randomly flipping your speed by
hitting you ...

